property done, ms, table
global glob

on startStep me
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setprop 66 .............................. done = 0
  [  3] getglobal 8 ............................. <glob>
  [  5] getchainedprop 9 ........................ <glob.managers>
  [  7] getchainedprop 10 ....................... <glob.managers.game>
  [  9] getchainedprop 11 ....................... <glob.managers.game.room>
  [ 11] getobjprop 70 ........................... <glob.managers.game.room.tables>
  [ 13] setlocal 0 .............................. t = glob.managers.game.room.tables
  [ 15] getlocal 0 .............................. <t>
  [ 17] getobjprop 59 ........................... <t.count>
  [ 19] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 21] nteq .................................... <t.count <> 2>
  [ 22] jmpifz [ 29] ............................ if t.count <> 2 then
  [ 25] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 27] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [ 29] getlocal 0 .............................. <t>
  [ 31] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 33] pusharglist 2 ........................... <t, 2>
  [ 35] objcall 25 .............................. <t[2]>
  [ 37] setprop 71 .............................. table = t[2]
  [ 39] getmovieprop 90 ......................... <the milliSeconds>
  [ 41] pushint16 2000 .......................... <2000>
  [ 44] add ..................................... <the milliSeconds + 2000>
  [ 45] setprop 89 .............................. ms = the milliSeconds + 2000
  [ 47] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 49] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <1>
  [ 51] extcall 44 .............................. return 1
  [ 53] ret
end

on checkDone me
  [  0] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [  2] getprop 71 .............................. <table>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <table>
  [  6] extcall 26 .............................. <voidp(table)>
  [  8] or ...................................... <done or voidp(table)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 16] ............................ if done or voidp(table) then
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 14] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [ 16] getmovieprop 90 ......................... <the milliSeconds>
  [ 18] getprop 89 .............................. <ms>
  [ 20] gt ...................................... <the milliSeconds > ms>
  [ 21] getprop 71 .............................. <table>
  [ 23] getobjprop 73 ........................... <table.sitterGroup>
  [ 25] pusharglist 1 ........................... <table.sitterGroup>
  [ 27] extcall 26 .............................. <voidp(table.sitterGroup)>
  [ 29] and ..................................... <(the milliSeconds > ms) and voidp(table.sitterGroup)>
  [ 30] setprop 66 .............................. done = (the milliSeconds > ms) and voidp(table.sitterGroup)
  [ 32] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [ 34] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <done>
  [ 36] extcall 44 .............................. return done
  [ 38] ret
end
